Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.63,0:00:05.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!! RESPAWN!!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.25,0:00:06.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!! RESPAWN!!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.83,0:00:08.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!! RESPAWN!!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.33,0:00:10.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nice to SEE YA!!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.00,0:00:11.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!! RESPAWN!!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.46,0:00:12.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!! RESPAWN!!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.13,0:00:14.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!! RESPAWN!!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.71,0:00:16.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nice to SEE YA!!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.63,0:00:26.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,The voice inside, brushed aside
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.83,0:00:29.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is beating in my heart
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.58,0:00:31.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should I end this run?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.17,0:00:33.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Those things I've yet to do
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.08,0:00:35.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Things I haven't been put through
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.88,0:00:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Worn-out and drained
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.17,0:00:41.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why be ashamed?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.79,0:00:43.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just stand tall
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.13,0:00:44.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just get mad
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.88,0:00:48.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,For the freedom that you never had!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.13,0:00:53.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shining pure, a new day's dawn glows
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.54,0:00:56.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Drench it red with a bloody blow!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.50,0:00:58.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's it, that's that!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.25,0:00:59.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to live!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.75,0:01:02.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Reborn once more, I gotta know
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.04,0:01:05.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not enough - so on I go!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.17,0:01:08.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Am I hurt or just in my head?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.17,0:01:10.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,My body goes on, I can't play dead
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.54,0:01:12.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,And what about you?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.29,0:01:14.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Some joke of a finale
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.42,0:01:17.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I won't crack a smile
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.71,0:01:19.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,No laughing matter
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.13,0:01:20.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll push on through!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.63,0:01:23.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Punch for your life!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.04,0:01:24.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Get up and fight!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.79,0:01:26.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!! RESPAWN!!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.29,0:01:28.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah yeah yeah yeah yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.25,0:01:36.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Heavenstriker Dojo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.04,0:01:37.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's an honor to have you here,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.00,0:01:38.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,Miss Nia!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,Uh, could you not?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.42,0:01:41.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.67,0:01:45.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,But honestly, age means nothing\Nin the pursuit of martial arts.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.92,0:01:46.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.17,0:01:49.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,strength is everything!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.58,0:01:53.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,If you would let me,\NI would prefer to call you my master.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.46,0:01:55.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you want to...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.42,0:01:57.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Can I really, Master Nia?!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.13,0:02:01.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,But you're in the Heavenstriker school,\Nand I'm not.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.13,0:02:05.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,Is it okay for you to call me your master?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.04,0:02:08.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,Well, that's the concern...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.25,0:02:15.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Like I requested before, we're going\Nto the Umbral Arena as parent and child.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.17,0:02:20.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,You're going to pretend to be my father,\Nso just talk like you normally do.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.08,0:02:23.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Ah, then I shall do my best, I will.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.42,0:02:25.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Like normal.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.21,0:02:29.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,About the arena.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.13,0:02:31.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,I have some new information.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.25,0:02:33.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard\Nof the Sword Demon, Miss Nia?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.92,0:02:35.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.08,0:02:37.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,I assume it's the nickname\Nof a master swordfighter?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.88,0:02:42.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yes, he's a sword-wielding adventurer\Nwho goes by that moniker.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.58,0:02:43.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.75,0:02:46.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose he's\Nas strong as he sounds, though.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.46,0:02:48.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,He's a renowned adventurer,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.54,0:02:51.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,so there seems to be\Nno doubt about his skills.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.08,0:02:53.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,Ooh, sounds promising!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.21,0:02:58.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,So apparently, this Sword Demon\Nwill be at the Umbral Arena!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.21,0:03:01.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Very nice! That's what I want to hear!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.17,0:03:03.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Really.\NThat's something to look forward to.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.58,0:03:06.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,I can't say I'm too thrilled.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.96,0:03:10.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,It just doesn't feel right bringing a child.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.08,0:03:16.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,But a promise is a promise.\NTake you I will, Miss Nia.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.33,0:03:17.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.83,0:03:19.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.04,0:03:20.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Gandolph!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.58,0:03:24.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,U-um, by the way...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.63,0:03:26.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,I hoped you'd have time for a lesson...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.42,0:03:30.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,Right now, my mood couldn't be better.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.54,0:03:33.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Ready yourself. Let's see what you can do.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.17,0:03:35.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Ah! I appreciate it!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.29,0:03:42.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,I think you need to work\Non breaking your falls.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.50,0:03:46.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Y-yesh, ma'am.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.04,0:03:51.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,Class, today we will be learning\Nabout the floating islands.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.50,0:03:56.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Long ago, all land was once\Nattached to the ocean floor
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.79,0:04:01.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,in one massive landmass,\Naccording to legend.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.54,0:04:04.25,Q3,,0,0,0,,However, hundreds of years\Nbefore you were all born,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.25,0:04:05.83,Q3,,0,0,0,,However, hundreds of years\Nbefore you were all born,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.25,0:04:05.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.83,0:04:08.63,Q4,,0,0,0,,legend has it that a beast\Nknown as the Earthsplitter Vikeranda...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.63,0:04:10.17,Q3,,0,0,0,,legend has it that a beast\Nknown as the Earthsplitter Vikeranda...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.63,0:04:10.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.38,0:04:17.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm back, Lynokis.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.29,0:04:20.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,Ah, welcome back, Young Mistress.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.17,0:04:23.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wow, those flowers are so pretty!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.88,0:04:30.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,Young Mistress, would you like some tea?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.21,0:04:32.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but not at the moment.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.58,0:04:41.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,Technically, I'm not entering the event\Nat the Umbral Arena.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.58,0:04:49.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Still, even as a spectator,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.83,0:04:54.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,I can't let my guard down\Nin front of such serious competitors.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.67,0:04:57.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,That's the minimum amount of respect\Nexpected of a martial artist.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.83,0:05:04.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.21,0:05:06.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.42,0:05:07.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.04,0:05:08.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.71,0:05:10.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.08,0:05:11.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.96,0:05:13.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,How go the preparations?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.29,0:05:17.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Everything is ready to go.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.96,0:05:18.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is it!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.71,0:05:19.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is it!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.71,0:05:19.71,Q5,,0,0,0,,Last one!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.71,0:05:20.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is it!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.42,0:05:26.46,Q7,,0,0,0,,Infiltrating the Umbral Arena
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.42,0:05:26.46,Q6,,0,0,0,,Episode 7
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.13,0:05:30.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.46,0:05:31.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,Finally, tonight's the night!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.96,0:05:33.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.21,0:05:36.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,What? Don't tell me you forgot, Nia.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.08,0:05:39.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,They're airing the\Nacademy martial arts tournament today.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.21,0:05:42.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,I bet everyone will get hooked\Non magivision!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.21,0:05:47.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,For the broadcast tonight,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.08,0:05:55.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,the castle is inviting the aristocrats with\Nchildren at the academy to a screening party.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.00,0:05:56.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,And in the dormitory...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.67,0:06:01.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'll be in it?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.54,0:06:03.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see Master Neal!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.42,0:06:04.58,Q4,,0,0,0,,Hurry, it's going to start soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.58,0:06:06.25,Q3,,0,0,0,,Hurry, it's going to start soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.58,0:06:06.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,I had them install a MagiPad\Nin time for the broadcast.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.25,0:06:07.75,Q3,,0,0,0,,Nearly there...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.25,0:06:07.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,I had them install a MagiPad\Nin time for the broadcast.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.75,0:06:08.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,I had them install a MagiPad\Nin time for the broadcast.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.29,0:06:09.29,Q3,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.29,0:06:09.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,I had them install a MagiPad\Nin time for the broadcast.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.29,0:06:09.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,I had them install a MagiPad\Nin time for the broadcast.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.92,0:06:12.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody. The pancakes are ready.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.83,0:06:14.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.17,0:06:15.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Ooh, ooh! I want one!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.88,0:06:16.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.75,0:06:17.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.75,0:06:21.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,No pushing.\NThere's enough for everyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.50,0:06:24.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,We can all enjoy them while we watch!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.42,0:06:25.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.75,0:06:29.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,So the idea is to share the excitement\Nover each match as a group.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.33,0:06:32.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,While I understand that sentiment...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.92,0:06:36.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,The Altoire Academy Martial Arts Tournament\Nis coming up next!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.08,0:06:41.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Um, Young Mistress?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.00,0:06:42.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to be here?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.83,0:06:44.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's about to start.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.75,0:06:48.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's fine.\NThey'll air it again later, anyway.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.54,0:06:51.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,They were giving these out in the dining hall,\Nso brought some.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.08,0:06:52.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,For you.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.33,0:06:55.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Goodness, just for me?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.88,0:06:58.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Young Mistress!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.25,0:06:59.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm retiring early tonight.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.83,0:07:06.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,About those pancakes, they're to die for\Ntopped with that cream on the side.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.21,0:07:07.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.88,0:07:15.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting,\Nladies and gentlemen!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.58,0:07:20.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,The Altoire Academy Martial Arts Tournament\Nis about to begin!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.38,0:07:24.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,Here, the contestants are on standby.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.96,0:07:27.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Every participant looks ready to go!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.54,0:07:31.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,We begin with the first match\Nof the armed division!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.38,0:07:52.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.50,0:07:55.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Look, right there! That's my kid!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.96,0:08:03.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,I wanted Nia to watch this with us...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.04,0:08:07.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Relia, look! That's me on the screen!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.96,0:08:30.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,So she really went.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.58,0:08:41.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,I just can't trust her, can I?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.04,0:09:02.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,Miss Nia!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.29,0:09:03.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.00,0:09:17.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to be fighting tonight,\Nbut still...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.50,0:09:23.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,We can't be sure what might happen.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.88,0:09:26.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,Looks tight on you.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.21,0:09:28.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,Well, I went overboard with my training.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.54,0:09:30.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.88,0:09:32.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,I brought the goods.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.96,0:09:34.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Good evening, Lily.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.54,0:09:39.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,That suit looks tight on you.\NCan you even lift your arm?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.13,0:09:41.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Does it look odd?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.71,0:09:43.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's acceptable.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.63,0:09:46.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,So you two know each other?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.08,0:09:48.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,I can see you hitting it off.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.63,0:09:50.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get started.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.54,0:10:06.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's stuff developed so royals and aristocrats\Ncan go about incognito.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.50,0:10:09.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,Even a bit of it costs more than you'd think.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.58,0:10:12.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,There, all done.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.96,0:10:16.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,How do I look?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.04,0:10:17.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Aww, you look adorable!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.75,0:10:18.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,Aww, you look adorable!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.75,0:10:18.63,Q5,,0,0,0,,It suits you well, Miss Nia!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.63,0:10:19.71,Q5,,0,0,0,,It suits you well, Miss Nia!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.71,0:10:22.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,You sure look plain without white hair.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.29,0:10:25.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Why can't any of you say\NI look like a different person?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.83,0:10:27.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,This is supposed to be a disguise.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.63,0:10:32.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose this will do.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.29,0:10:35.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,You owe me for this, you realize.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.96,0:10:39.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'll pay you back when I'm old enough\Nto compete in the Umbral Arena.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.08,0:10:44.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,So years from now?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.54,0:11:03.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.92,0:11:05.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,His daughter.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.67,0:11:09.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Y-y-yes, my doffer...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.54,0:11:11.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Daughter!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.63,0:11:32.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,Get it started, already!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.54,0:11:33.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,Get it started, already!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.54,0:11:33.63,Q5,,0,0,0,,I'm betting all I've got to pay off a debt!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.63,0:11:35.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,What raw thirst for violence.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.63,0:11:35.17,Q5,,0,0,0,,I'm betting all I've got to pay off a debt!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.17,0:11:36.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,What raw thirst for violence.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.79,0:11:40.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,I can smell the fury, disgrace, and aggression\Npractically dripping from the walls.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.96,0:11:46.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's irresistible!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.92,0:12:03.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,Just listen to the excitement.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.21,0:12:11.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Will wine do, sir?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.63,0:12:12.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.13,0:12:14.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh-huh!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.88,0:12:18.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,What about the young lady?\NWould you like some juice?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.75,0:12:19.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.54,0:12:24.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hello all, and welcome!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.67,0:12:27.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,The time has come for another night\Nof bloody entertainment,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.96,0:12:32.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,where flesh will be torn apart\Nin fights to the death!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.25,0:12:35.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,So sit back and enjoy the show!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.04,0:12:40.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Well, let's get on with it, shall we?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.50,0:12:42.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Starting with these two!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.00,0:12:49.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,The Red Fist Draijan!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.00,0:12:49.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,You got him!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.88,0:12:51.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.38,0:12:53.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Up against him is the\Nmaster of lightning-fast kicks,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.67,0:12:55.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Woobie!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.83,0:12:56.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,Woobie!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.83,0:12:56.54,Q5,,0,0,0,,Woobie!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.54,0:12:57.04,Q5,,0,0,0,,Woobie!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.04,0:12:58.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Woobie, show him what you've got!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.75,0:12:59.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Crush him!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.79,0:13:02.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Which would you like to bet on?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.33,0:13:03.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Uh?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.08,0:13:06.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hmm, out of those two...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.13,0:13:09.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,bet on tattoo guy.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.58,0:13:12.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,From what I can see,\Nhe's the stronger one.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.33,0:13:14.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,No, I don't really want to gamble...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.63,0:13:17.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,You're already here.\NWhy should you have to hold back?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.83,0:13:20.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,You might as well enjoy this for what it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.83,0:13:21.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.13,0:13:24.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,But I don't have much money to spare.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.58,0:13:27.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,If I lose, I'll only get a slice of bread\Na day for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.92,0:13:29.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.21,0:13:32.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,You mean you don't trust my advice?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.58,0:13:34.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'll bet everything I have!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.25,0:13:36.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.08,0:13:39.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,Now, let the match begin!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.67,0:14:00.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.08,0:14:09.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,M-Miss Nia?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.54,0:14:11.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm sweating out of control.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.46,0:14:13.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Relax, you earned this.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.75,0:14:15.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,B-but...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.17,0:14:18.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,I've never seen this much money in my life.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.83,0:14:20.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should stop here?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.00,0:14:22.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,That's a shame.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.33,0:14:25.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,I thought this could be your pocket money.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.21,0:14:29.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,Are you quite sure, sir?\NYou may want to wait for the main event.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.08,0:14:31.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,No, I'm done betting.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.75,0:14:38.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.33,0:14:42.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,For the wine and juice you brought.\NThat's yours to keep, for your troubles.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.17,0:14:44.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,Ah. Thank you, miss!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.58,0:14:48.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,Miss Nia, what was that all about?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.21,0:14:50.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,Once you win this much,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.13,0:14:53.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,you're expected to give some back\Nso as not to upset the house.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.13,0:14:56.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Especially when it's\Nour first time gambling here.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.79,0:15:00.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Besides, she'll get some of that as a tip.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.29,0:15:02.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.96,0:15:06.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,Now, time to focus on the matches.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.21,0:15:07.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.58,0:15:10.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Now that the opening matches\Nare out of the way,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.75,0:15:12.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,let's see who's up next!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.54,0:15:27.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.13,0:15:32.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,The mysterious female fighter, Miss Servant,\Nin her Umbral debut!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.79,0:15:36.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Will she prove herself worthy\Nof playing in the big leagues?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.88,0:15:39.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,That woman has control of her chi,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.83,0:15:43.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,though she's unfledged,\Nlike a freshly born chick.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.25,0:15:45.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wow, I like her!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.25,0:15:47.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Huh? Um, Miss Nia?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.71,0:15:49.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,I wonder if her opponent is strong, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.75,0:15:54.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Up against her is the\NMystic Butterfly of the Night, Scarlet!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.50,0:15:58.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,Her trusty whip is out\Nfor the blood of her prey!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.67,0:16:00.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Whip me too!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.17,0:16:03.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't think this one's worth noting.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.46,0:16:04.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,She's all show.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.42,0:16:07.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,The one in the mask will win.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.33,0:16:11.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,But uh, Miss Nia...\NYou're not serious, are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.33,0:16:12.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.33,0:16:14.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Keep a proper eye on the match, will you?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.46,0:16:16.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,I doubt it will last more than one blow.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.71,0:16:19.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,No, I mean...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.75,0:16:24.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,Um. Miss Nia, I may be mistaken, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.42,0:16:26.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Will you just say it?!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.25,0:16:28.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Well, how do I put this...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.58,0:16:31.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Now, let the match begin!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.92,0:16:35.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Isn't that your personal attendant?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.79,0:16:36.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.54,0:16:39.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,Whoa?!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.79,0:16:45.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,S-Scarlet has been sent flying... I believe?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.08,0:16:47.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.92,0:16:49.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.63,0:16:53.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,M-Miss Servant wins!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.29,0:16:56.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Oh. That's Lynokis, all right.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.67,0:17:11.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she's actually here.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.92,0:17:13.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,After all my protesting, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.21,0:17:17.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Ha! Not bad, new face...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.46,0:17:20.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yo, didn't you hear me-
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.21,0:17:22.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,Back off, scum. Get lost.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.21,0:17:39.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,But why would Lynokis be here?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.79,0:17:42.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,I think it's pretty obvious.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.04,0:17:43.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.96,0:17:48.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,Because she wanted\Nto face stronger opponents?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.04,0:17:49.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.46,0:17:51.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Isn't it to protect you?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.50,0:17:54.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Huh? Even though I'm stronger?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.50,0:17:57.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,I-I don't think that matters.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.67,0:18:00.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.33,0:18:05.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Lynokis was concerned about me\Nand my family's good name.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.33,0:18:07.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,So she decided to carry out
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.29,0:18:10.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,her duty of protecting me\Nby entering the fight in disguise.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.54,0:18:12.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wow, okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.75,0:18:15.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Who thought she would go this far?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.50,0:18:17.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,But if she keeps fighting,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.50,0:18:20.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,won't she be up against\Nthe Sword Demon?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.50,0:18:22.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.42,0:18:26.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Honestly, that just makes me jealous.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.29,0:18:31.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Now for tonight's main event!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.38,0:18:33.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,The dungeon-ravaging bounty hunter,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.04,0:18:37.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,the master swordsman\Nwho cuts down whole golems with ease,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.25,0:18:40.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,the adventurer known\Nas the Sword Demon...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.08,0:18:43.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Asuma Hinoki!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.38,0:18:44.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Asuma Hinoki!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.38,0:18:44.92,Q5,,0,0,0,,That's the Sword Demon?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.92,0:18:45.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Asuma Hinoki!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.00,0:18:50.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,I don't like the look of him.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.13,0:18:54.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,That's a demon blade.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.00,0:18:55.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,Demon blade?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.29,0:18:59.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,A blade with demonic power\Nthat can possess its wielder.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.08,0:19:02.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,It removes any reason or morality
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.21,0:19:04.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,that prevents one\Nfrom cutting a person down.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.75,0:19:07.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,You mean anyone who wields the sword...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.13,0:19:10.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,...can use it to kill, without hesitation.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.54,0:19:17.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,I refuse to acknowledge the use of martial arts\Nfor pure violence or a means to kill.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.58,0:19:21.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Reason, self-restraint, conviction,\Nand ambition...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.75,0:19:25.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,A martial art is not viable\Nwithout encompassing those virtues.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.96,0:19:29.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,Mindless violence... isn't the same.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.83,0:19:34.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Still, demon blades are masterfully forged.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.33,0:19:37.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,I can understand the desire\Nto use a well-crafted blade.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.71,0:19:42.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,I just hope he's the kind of swordsman\Nwith the conviction to control the blade.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.67,0:19:47.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Sword Demon Asuma\Ndemolishes his sixth opponent!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.25,0:19:49.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,Six swift victories in a row!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.88,0:19:54.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.08,0:19:55.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Give us more!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.21,0:19:58.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wow, another instant defeat!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.00,0:20:00.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,You're pathetic!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.33,0:20:02.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,You lost me good money, you jerk!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.00,0:20:05.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,His opponents are too weak!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.38,0:20:11.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,There needs to be some worthy competition for\Nthe Sword Demon to show off his true skills.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.88,0:20:14.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Argh, let me fight.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.71,0:20:16.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,I want to see how strong he is
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.46,0:20:20.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,and feel out the demon blade\Nwhile pushing him to his limit!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.75,0:20:22.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Show us more!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.33,0:20:24.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Who's next, huh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.00,0:20:25.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.50,0:20:27.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Silence, I say!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.67,0:20:31.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,I seek a fight with Miss Servant!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.25,0:20:33.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Lynokis!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.50,0:20:38.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,Servant!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.29,0:20:46.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Servant! Servant!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.79,0:20:48.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Ugh, no fair.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.25,0:20:50.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,I wish he'd challenge me\Nto a fight too.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.17,0:20:54.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Here she comes, Miss Servant!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.75,0:21:00.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,Will your personal attendant be all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.79,0:21:05.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Knowing Lynokis's current abilities,\NI feel like she has a good chance,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.04,0:21:07.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,but we'll see.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.50,0:21:12.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Count yourself unlucky.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.04,0:21:25.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,Now let the match...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.00,0:21:27.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,begin!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.42,0:21:57.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.46,0:21:58.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,Finish her!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.79,0:22:09.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.25,0:22:19.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Bravo, I must say.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.54,0:22:24.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do we only live once?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.33,0:22:26.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then savor everything it has to offer!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.38,0:22:28.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't waste it being picky
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.50,0:22:30.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Try, Try, Try!!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.58,0:22:34.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,A dazzling world beyond the screen
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.63,0:22:38.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why not take a little peek?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.38,0:22:42.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,If your days are boring
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.46,0:22:46.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's get away on a flying ship
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.67,0:22:48.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Any good ideas?"
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.04,0:22:49.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,"A blood-soaked fight to the death?"
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.58,0:22:52.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Too violent! Something more elegant and fun."
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.50,0:22:53.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Oh, I know then!"
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.63,0:22:54.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Let's have a ball (tournament)!"
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.75,0:22:58.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Making decisions for XYZ is up to us
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.71,0:23:03.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not anyone else
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.08,0:23:06.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,One, two, three! One, two, three!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.42,0:23:09.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now, go with the rhythm
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.25,0:23:10.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Un, deux, trois! Un, deux, trois!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.42,0:23:13.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, take a step forward
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.29,0:23:16.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's new exciting things that we never knew
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.13,0:23:21.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,For us to encounter out there
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.33,0:23:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,One, two, three! One, two, three!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.67,0:23:25.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now, with our hearts as one
Dialogue: 1,0:23:25.54,0:23:26.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Un, deux, trois! Un, deux, trois!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.79,0:23:29.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look, just try dancing
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.29,0:23:33.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It could change fate and even the world
Dialogue: 1,0:23:33.33,0:23:36.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a lovely waltz, shall we dance?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:37.75,0:23:39.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do we only live once?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.54,0:23:41.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then savor everything it has to offer!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:41.58,0:23:45.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,All the excitement and much, much more!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:51.75,0:23:54.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Next time:\N"The Sword Demon's Blade"
Dialogue: 1,0:23:51.75,0:23:55.92,Q9,,0,0,0,,The Sword Demon's Blade
Dialogue: 1,0:23:51.75,0:23:55.92,Q8,,0,0,0,,Next Time

